{{cardinalbox|la|LXIX|LXX|LXXI|undeseptuaginta|alt=septuāgintā|ord=septuagesimus|ordalt=septuāgēsimus|headlink=Appendix:Latin cardinal numerals}}

===Alternative forms===
* Symbol: '''LXX'''

===Etymology===
From earlier {{term||septmāginta}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|la}} {{recons|septm̥̄ḱomt|lang=ine-pro}}, from earlier {{recons|septḿ̥-dḱomt||seven-ten|lang=ine-pro}}. Cognate with Ancient Greek {{term|sc=polytonic|ἑβδομήκοντα|tr=hebdomēkonta|lang=grc}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Classical}} {{IPA|/sepˌtu.aːˈɡin.taː/|lang=la}}
* {{audio|la-cls-septuaginta.ogg|Audio (Classical)}}

===Numeral===
